  "published": "2026-10-29T15:23:57.15Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.2: scheduling and scratch. JPEG reconstruction writes DC-first scans in parallel chunks with a 64-bit bit accumulator; MA-tree learning, RCT choice and palette discovery run in parallel; lossy encoder search scratch sized for DCT64x64. Output identical to 0.8.1 at every thread count. vs 0.8.1 on 16 logical CPUs: JPEG reconstruction 4.2x, lossless encode (effort 7) 1.3-2.8x, lossy encode effort 1-3 7.6% faster with 3x less allocation; 1 thread: JPEG reconstruction 20% faster, other cases within noise. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.2.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
